# UniKit hub aliases — inherited from the previous hub Worker (apps/hub in
# unikit-ui). Exact + splat forms; specific rules stay above general ones.
# Cloudflare Pages evaluates these only when no static asset matches.

/ui     https://ui.ll3.kr 302
/ui/*   https://ui.ll3.kr/:splat 302

/scriptca     https://scriptca.ll3.kr 302
/scriptca/*   https://scriptca.ll3.kr/:splat 302

# rustra.ll3.kr is not deployed yet (deploy-rustra.yml on unikit-ui main is
# pending its Pages-project-create fix). Point the alias at the repo until the
# site goes live, then flip both lines to https://rustra.ll3.kr.
/rustra     https://github.com/loopy-lim/unikit-bridge 302
/rustra/*   https://github.com/loopy-lim/unikit-bridge 302

# SPA fallback — 마지막 규칙. 에셋은 항상 우선하고, 위 alias에 안 걸린
# 경로(오탈자 URL 등)도 사이트 크롬을 유지한 채 index로 안내한다.
/* /index.html 200
